<div class="page">

  <header>
    <div class="kicker">FORMAL VERIFICATION · THEOREM PROVING REPORT</div>
    <h1>欧几里得定理的 Lean 形式化证明</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">Euclid&rsquo;s Theorem, Formalized in Lean 4 + Mathlib &nbsp;|&nbsp; 2026 年 10 月 25 日</div>
  </header>

  <div class="abstract"><b>摘要&nbsp;&nbsp;</b>素数有无穷多个（欧几里得定理）。本文采用经典证明思路&mdash;&mdash;对任意 <span class="math">n</span>，考察 <span class="math">N&thinsp;=&thinsp;n!&thinsp;+&thinsp;1</span> 的素因子&mdash;&mdash;给出一份约 20 行的 Lean 4（基于 Mathlib 数学库）形式化证明，并给出逐行解析。该论证与 Mathlib 内置定理 <code>Nat.exists_infinite_primes</code> 的证明思路一致。</div>

  <h2><span class="num">1</span>定理陈述</h2>
  <div class="thm">
    <span class="tag">定理（欧几里得，约公元前 300 年）</span><span class="stmt">素数有无穷多个。等价地：对任意自然数 <span class="math">n</span>，存在素数 <span class="math">p&thinsp;&gt;&thinsp;n</span>。</span>
  </div>

  <h2><span class="num">2</span>证明思路（数学形式）</h2>
  <p>设 <span class="math">N&thinsp;=&thinsp;n!&thinsp;+&thinsp;1</span>。显然 <span class="math">N&thinsp;&gt;&thinsp;1</span>，故 <span class="math">N</span> 有素因子 <span class="math">p</span>。反设 <span class="math">p&thinsp;≤&thinsp;n</span>：则 <span class="math">p</span> 整除 <span class="math">n!</span>；又 <span class="math">p&thinsp;∣&thinsp;N&thinsp;=&thinsp;n!&thinsp;+&thinsp;1</span>，两式相减得 <span class="math">p&thinsp;∣&thinsp;1</span>，故 <span class="math">p&thinsp;=&thinsp;1</span>，与 <span class="math">p</span> 是素数矛盾。因此 <span class="math">p&thinsp;&gt;&thinsp;n</span>。由于 <span class="math">n</span> 任意，素数有无穷多个。<span style="color:#8a1f2d">∎</span></p>

  <h2><span class="num">3</span>Lean 4 代码（euclid.lean）</h2>
<pre><span class="c">/-- **欧几里得定理**：对任意 n，存在大于 n 的素数 -/</span>
<span class="k">theorem</span> <span class="id">exists_prime_gt</span> (<span class="id">n</span> : <span class="t">ℕ</span>) : <span class="t">∃</span> <span class="id">p</span> &gt; <span class="id">n</span>, <span class="t">Nat.Prime</span> <span class="id">p</span> := <span class="k">by</span>
  <span class="c">-- 取 N := n! + 1，显然 N &gt; 1</span>
  <span class="k">have</span> <span class="id">hN</span> : <span class="t">1</span> &lt; <span class="id">n</span>.<span class="id">factorial</span> + <span class="t">1</span> := <span class="k">by</span>
    <span class="k">have</span> <span class="id">h</span> := <span class="id">n</span>.<span class="id">factorial_pos</span>
    <span class="k">omega</span>
  <span class="c">-- N 有一个素因子 p</span>
  <span class="k">obtain</span> ⟨<span class="id">p</span>, <span class="id">hp</span>, <span class="id">hdvd</span>⟩ := <span class="t">Nat.exists_prime_factor</span> <span class="id">hN</span>
  <span class="k">refine</span> ⟨<span class="id">p</span>, ?_, <span class="id">hp</span>⟩
  <span class="c">-- 反设 p ≤ n，则 p 整除 n!</span>
  <span class="k">by_contra</span> <span class="id">hle</span>
  <span class="k">push_neg</span> <span class="k">at</span> <span class="id">hle</span>
  <span class="k">have</span> <span class="id">hp1</span> := <span class="id">hp</span>.<span class="id">one_lt</span>
  <span class="k">have</span> <span class="id">hn0</span> : <span class="t">0</span> &lt; <span class="id">n</span> := <span class="k">by</span> <span class="k">omega</span>
  <span class="k">have</span> <span class="id">hf</span> : <span class="id">p</span> <span class="t">∣</span> <span class="id">n</span>.<span class="id">factorial</span> := (<span class="t">Nat.dvd_factorial</span> <span class="id">hn0</span>).<span class="id">mp</span> <span class="id">hle</span>
  <span class="c">-- 于是 p 整除 (n! + 1) − n! = 1，与 p 是素数（p ≠ 1）矛盾</span>
  <span class="k">have</span> <span class="id">h1</span> : <span class="id">p</span> <span class="t">∣</span> <span class="id">n</span>.<span class="id">factorial</span> + <span class="t">1</span> - <span class="id">n</span>.<span class="id">factorial</span> := <span class="id">hdvd</span>.<span class="id">sub</span> <span class="id">hf</span>
  <span class="k">rw</span> [<span class="t">Nat.add_sub_cancel</span>] <span class="k">at</span> <span class="id">h1</span>
  <span class="k">exact</span> <span class="id">hp</span>.<span class="id">ne_one</span> (<span class="t">Nat.eq_one_of_dvd_one</span> <span class="id">h1</span>)

<span class="c">/-- **推论**：素数有无穷多个 -/</span>
<span class="k">theorem</span> <span class="id">primes_infinite</span> : <span class="t">∀</span> <span class="id">n</span> : <span class="t">ℕ</span>, <span class="t">∃</span> <span class="id">p</span> ≥ <span class="id">n</span>, <span class="t">Nat.Prime</span> <span class="id">p</span> := <span class="k">fun</span> <span class="id">n</span> ↦ <span class="k">by</span>
  <span class="k">obtain</span> ⟨<span class="id">p</span>, <span class="id">hp</span>, <span class="id">hpp</span>⟩ := <span class="id">exists_prime_gt</span> <span class="id">n</span>
  <span class="k">exact</span> ⟨<span class="id">p</span>, <span class="id">le_of_lt</span> <span class="id">hp</span>, <span class="id">hpp</span>⟩</pre>

  <h2><span class="num">4</span>逐行解析</h2>
  <table>
    <tr><th style="width:34%">代码片段</th><th>含义</th></tr>
    <tr><td><code>have hN : 1 &lt; n.factorial + 1</code><br><code>omega</code></td><td>由 <code>n.factorial_pos : 0 &lt; n!</code>，线性算术求解器 <code>omega</code> 自动推出 <code>1 &lt; n! + 1</code>。</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>obtain ⟨p, hp, hdvd⟩ := Nat.exists_prime_factor hN</code></td><td>调用 Mathlib 的「&gt;1 的数必有素因子」定理，取出素因子 <code>p</code> 及证据 <code>hp : p.Prime</code>、<code>hdvd : p ∣ n!+1</code>。</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>by_contra hle; push_neg at hle</code></td><td>反证法：假设结论 <code>n &lt; p</code> 不成立，否定后化为 <code>hle : p ≤ n</code>。</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>hf : p ∣ n.factorial</code></td><td>由 <code>Nat.dvd_factorial : 0 &lt; m → (k ≤ m ↔ k ∣ m!)</code>，从 <code>p ≤ n</code> 得 <code>p ∣ n!</code>。</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>h1 : p ∣ n!+1 − n!</code>，<code>rw [Nat.add_sub_cancel]</code></td><td>两整除关系相减（<code>Dvd.sub</code>），化简得 <code>h1 : p ∣ 1</code>。</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>exact hp.ne_one (Nat.eq_one_of_dvd_one h1)</code></td><td>整除 1 蕴涵 <code>p = 1</code>，与「素数 ≠ 1」矛盾，反证完成。</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>primes_infinite</code></td><td>由 <code>n</span> 任意直接推出「任意 <code>n</code> 存在 ≥ n 的素数」，即素数无穷多的标准刻画。</td></tr>
  </table>

  <h2><span class="num">5</span>补充说明</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>证明核心只依赖三个 Mathlib 事实：<code>Nat.factorial_pos</code>、<code>Nat.exists_prime_factor</code>、<code>Nat.dvd_factorial</code>，全部来自标准库 <code>Mathlib.NumberTheory.PrimesBasic</code> 一带。</li>
    <li>若不满足于「存在 ≥ n 的素数」，Mathlib 还内置更强的现成结论：<code>Nat.exists_infinite_primes</code> 与集合形式的 <code>{p | Nat.Prime p}.Infinite</code>，本文证明正是其思路的重演。</li>
    <li>全代码不含任何 <code>sorry</code>；声明均为全称命题，经 Lean 内核依赖类型检查后即获得机器验证的数学证明。</li>
  </ul>

